      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608252317451570.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608252317451570_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608252317451570_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/match2119564date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">让二追三！十人胜利3-2达曼协作 C罗半场被换下马内双响本托直红</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.64" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260826/zhanbao_image_2119564_1787687775_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.64" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.64" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260826/zhanbao_image_2119564_1787687775_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260826/zhanbao_image_2119564_1787687775_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>十人利雅得胜利3-2大逆转达曼协作。门将本托上半场直红，C罗半场被换，下半场马内双响、阿姆里破门，菲利克斯两助。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/match2129732date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">惊天大逆转！林茨让四追五加时5-4逆转凯尔特人 队史首进欧冠正赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.55" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260826/zhanbao_image_2129732_1787696473_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260826/zhanbao_image_2129732_1787696473_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260826/zhanbao_image_2129732_1787696473_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>欧冠附加赛次回合，奥甲球队LASK林茨坐镇主场上演惊天翻盘，在总比分0-4落后的绝境下连追五球，最终以5-4的总比分淘汰苏超球队凯尔特人，队史首次跻身欧冠正赛。</p><p>【曼联官宣巴莱巴】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a89c2c2ca50anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">新腰到位！官方：曼联签下布莱顿22岁中场巴莱巴，总价7000万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/202608231653205123.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/202608231653205123.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260823/202608231653205123.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，曼联签下22岁布莱顿中场巴莱巴，合同期限至2031年6月，包含可再延长一年的选项，球员将身披20号球衣。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-25/6a8dbb1865e2anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴莱巴：加盟曼联的感觉令人难以置信，等不及想和卡里克共事</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608252356193038.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608252356193038.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/202608252356193038.jpg"> </div><p>曼联官方宣布，球队签下布莱顿中场巴莱巴。正式加盟后，巴莱巴谈到了加盟曼联的感受。</p><p>【森林签德拉普HWG】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8dcbd70fbbenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：森林签德拉普达成口头协议，转会费约4500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260108165269_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260108165269_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260108165269_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，诺丁汉森林签切尔西中锋德拉普达成口头协议，转会费约4500万镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8dcda348039native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">蓝军4500万镑卖德拉普！记者感叹：难以置信，森林是抽大了吗？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.06" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260115255608.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.06" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.06" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260115255608_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260115255608_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺以here we go确认，德拉普以4500万镑加盟森林。蓝军方面的记者Simon phillips发文感叹，他认为这笔交易对于蓝军太棒了。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8dd96651f84native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">太会卖了！电讯报：德拉普不止4500万镑，蓝军还另要了500万浮动</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250617/68508bfc699f4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250617/68508bfc699f4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250617/68508bfc699f4.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺以here we go确认，切尔西前锋德拉普以4500万镑转会森林达协议。但电讯报记者Matt Law、蓝军跟队Kieran Gill都表示，这笔交易的金额还要更高。</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8dd4ecdf8fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">超1.2亿镑！ESPN：曼城准备1.45亿欧报价恩佐 球员已表达转会意愿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/6a8d4cde344e7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/6a8d4cde344e7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260825/6a8d4cde344e7.jpg"> </div><p>ESPN巴西报道，曼城准备1.45亿欧（约1.24亿镑）报价恩佐，球员已向切尔西表达转会意愿。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8dd4faa6377native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：米兰前锋恩昆库租借回归莱比锡，买断选项稍低于3000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260147587582.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260147587582_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260826/202608260147587582_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，米兰前锋恩昆库租借回归莱比锡，租期为一个赛季，含买断选项。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8e100acbe54native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：小蜘蛛现在面前只有两条路，留队或者加盟阿森纳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8.jpg"> </div><p>记者Rubén Uría消息，阿尔瓦雷斯与马竞之间的关系正越来越紧张，多个可靠的消息源都表示，现在摆在阿尔瓦雷斯面前的只有明确的两条路。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8e0da193bf9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：贝西克塔斯租借米雷蒂达成协议，买断费超1000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260826/202608260550445059.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260826/202608260550445059.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260826/202608260550445059.jpg"> </div><p>知名记者罗马诺报道，贝西克塔斯租借米雷蒂达成口头协议，Here we go！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8de30261355native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：马丁内利转会新月交易已到最后阶段，总价超6500万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺消息，阿森纳与新月就马丁内利的谈判已经到了最终阶段，转会费总价超过6500万欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-26/6a8e19303f4f6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">塞尔：曼联准备3000万欧报价巴尔德，5000万欧报价卡马文加</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a82fe9b78a9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a82fe9b78a9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a82fe9b78a9.jpg"> </d